nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver is a metapackage. It pulls in the runtime
libraries, the Xorg driver, the utilities, the kernel-support glue and (for the
DKMS flavour) the DKMS module source for NVIDIA 390.157.

Hardware: Fermi, Kepler (GeForce 400/500/600/700 series)
Upstream status: Upstream EOL 2022-12. Community-patched for newer kernels/Xorg.

To remove every trace:  apt purge '~nnvidia-legacy-390xx-.*'
